an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    criteria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    autoGrading</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rule_based'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'computer_vision'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    dispositionRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      grade_a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'restock'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      grade_b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refurbish'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      grade_c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'liquidate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      grade_d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dispose'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>即时退款（Instant Refund）是提升退货体验的关键创新。传统流程中，用户需要等到仓库收到退货并完成质检后才能收到退款（通常 5-10 天）。即时退款在用户发起退货请求的当刻就启动退款，商品在途过程中资金已经返还用户。这种模式适用于金额较低或用户信用评分较高的场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退款时机</th>\n<th>用户等待时间</th>\n<th>商家风险</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申请即退</td>\n<td>0天</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低金额/高信用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>揽收即退</td>\n<td>1-2天</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中等金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签收即退</td>\n<td>3-5天</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>标准流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质检后退</td>\n<td>5-10天</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>高金额/可疑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"退货物流\">退货物流</h2><p>退货物流（逆向物流）的复杂度远高于正向物流——退货包裹来源分散、品类混杂、状态不确定。退货物流方式主要有用户自寄、上门取件和定点投递三种。</p>\n<p>用户自寄是成本最低的方式——系统生成退货面单，用户自行打包后到快递网点寄出。上门取件虽然用户体验最好，但单次取件成本（¥5-15）远高于集中收件。定点投递（到附近驿站/自提柜投递退货）在成本和体验间取得较好平衡。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ReturnLogistics {&#10;  methods: {&#10;    selfShip: {&#10;      enabled: boolean;&#10;      labelFormat: &#39;pdf&#39; | &#39;qr_code&#39;;&#10;      dropoffPartners: string[];&#10;      estimatedDays: number;&#10;    };&#10;    scheduledPickup: {&#10;      enabled: boolean;&#10;      carriers: string[];&#10;      timeSlots: { date: string; slot: string }[];&#10;      pickupFee: number;&#10;      freePickupThreshold: number;&#10;    };&#10;    dropoffPoint: {&#10;      enabled: boolean;&#10;      networkType: &#39;locker&#39; | &#39;station&#39; | &#39;store&#39;;&#10;      nearby: { radiusKm: number; maxResults: number };&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  consolidation: {&#10;    returnCenter: string;&#10;    sortingProcess: &#39;manual&#39; | &#39;automated&#39;;&#10;    processingCapacity: number;&#10;    averageProcessingTime: number;&#10;  };&#10;  tracking: {&#10;    returnTracking: boolean;&#10;    statusUpdates: (&#39;picked_up&#39; | &#39;in_transit&#39; | &#39;received&#39; | &#39;inspected&#39; | &#39;refunded&#39;)[];&#10;    notificationChannels: string[];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReturnLogistics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  methods</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    selfShip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span 